                                <rect key="frame" x="60" y="184" width="273" height="512"/>
                                <color key="backgroundColor" systemColor="secondaryLabelColor"/>
                                <string key="text">Our project will be a Cookbook App. The App will provide menus for Brekafast, Lunch, and additionally provide a search function tofilter by keyword, like dairy-free, vegan, gluten-free, dinner, etc. You will have the option to add menu items yourself, which will be saved permanently. You can select tags for the items, to allow filtering to search for them.</string>
